contribute. Also we would like to open for new developers to enhance the team.

Please help us to develop better content to our project pages and port the
missing pages from old server to a wiki style (there are online web translators
from html to wiki dialects)

And btw if you want to become a lm-sensors developer/contributor/support
specialist with own account please let us know too.

Feedback welcomed.

I would like to thank especially to Axel and Phil with the migration efforts.

